title: MarcHouseMorning
---
<<changeBG 0>>
{$protagName} stands in front of his bathroom mirror, clutching at the fabric of his necktie. 

{$protagName}: (<i>Over, under, around, through the loop? Wait, no.</i>)

{$protagName}: (<i>Which side is supposed to be longer? They look the same!</i>)

The fabric gives way, clumping into a tangle in {$protagName}’s hands.

{$protagName}: Great. Magnificent work, Malkin.

{$protagName} drops the tie onto the counter and picks up his folded sweater.

{$protagName}: Hmm, should I just wear this instead?

As {$protagName} grabs at the sweater, he hears a sound coming from the kitchen.

<i>Sizzle, sizzle, sizzle</i>

The noise {$protagName} heard was far too familiar for him to ignore.

{$protagName}: No. Oh no. Not today.

{$protagName} bolts through the door of the bathroom, sweater in hand.

//Scene 2
<<changeBG 1>>
As {$protagName} turns into the kitchen, he sees the kettle overboiling on the stove.

{$protagName}: (<i>Where is everybody? Who just leaves water boiling in a room?</i>)

<i>Sizzle, sizzle, sizzle</i>

As {$protagName} darts forward to grab the handle of the kettle, the boiling water spills over the top and lands across the back of his wrist. 

{$protagName}: Are you kidding me!

{$protagName} quickly moves his hand away from the stove and looks at where he was splashed.

{$protagName}: (<i>That’s definitely going to leave a mark…</i>)

{$protagName}: <i>Sigh</i>, just my luck.

{$protagName}: Who was even down here befo-

{$protagName}: (<i>Is that a note on the counter?</i>)

{$protagName} lays the sweater on the counter and goes to inspect the piece of paper sitting next to the stove. 

“Decided to make you coffee for your first day. You’re welcome.” - Art

{$protagName}: Ha… well at least he tried.

{$protagName}: (<i>I didn’t realize that Art remembered today is my first day at the museum.</i>)

{$protagName}: (<i>Seems like my baby brother is finally growing up.</i>)

{$protagName} grabs his sweater and leaves home, making his way to the city’s museum.

//Scene 3
<<changeBG 2>>
As {$protagName} is walking, he looks around at the people around the town square. 

{$protagName}: (<i>Look at all of them.</i>)

{$protagName}: (<i>Tourists, commuters, students… Seems like everybody has somewhere to be.</i>)

A crisp breeze brushes {$protagName}’s face.

{$protagName}: (<i>Maybe today won’t be so bad after all, burnt wrist aside.</i>)

{$protagName}: (<i>How hard can working at a museum really be?</i>)

{$protagName}: (<i>Curating history, preserving art? Sounds… fun!</i>)

{$protagName}: <i>Sigh</i>. Well, here goes nothing.

{$protagName} starts making his way towards the museum for his first day.

===

title: MuseumIntro
tags:
---
<<set $protagName = "Marc">>
<<set $lover1Name = "Jovan">>
<<set $lover2Name = "Ruzica">>
<<declare $loverLastName = "Lukashov">>
<<declare $directorName = "Petar">>

<<oneChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 4>>
<<darken 1>>

{$protagName} looks around the museum in awe.
<<lighten 1>>
{$directorName}: Are you just going to stand there?
->Wow, the tree is… so tall.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: So, this is the tree?
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$directorName}: Congrats, you know what a tree is.
    <<darken 1>>
->You must be the manager?
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: You must be the manager?
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$directorName}: Yes, I am.
    <<darken 1>>
-><i>Stay Silent</i>
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$directorName}: Good morning to you too, Mr. Malkin.
    <<darken 1>>
{$directorName} gives {$protagName} a look.
<<lighten 1>>
{$directorName}: I’m sure you’re aware of why you’re here.
<<darken 1>>
{$directorName} points at {$protagName}'s hand.
<<lighten 1>>
{$directorName}: And do I even want to know what happened there?
<<darken 1>>
{$protagName}: Just a small accident making breakfast
{$protagName} and {$directorName} stare at each other in awkward silence. {$protagName}, confused, clears his throat.
->I feel like I've done something wrong.
    {$protagName}: I feel like I've done something wrong.
    {$directorName} glares at {$protagName}, but says nothing.
->So, where should I get started?
    {$protagName}: So, where should I get started?
<<lighten 1>>
{$directorName}: Follow me to the <b>War Artifact</b> room.
<<darken 1>>

<<zeroChar>>
<color=\#7F7F7F>You can move to another room by tapping/clicking on the entrance.</color>
===
